This modification
-----------------
New files written for this project (components/grok/, companion/, web/,
tests/, docs/PROTOCOL.md, partitions.csv) are GPL-3.0-or-later. Because the
upstream work is GPL-3.0 only, the combined firmware is distributed under
GPL-3.0-only. The full license is in LICENSE.

Upstream files changed here carry a "Modified by pileofflapjacks1, 2026"
note at the top: CMakeLists.txt, main/CMakeLists.txt, main/main.c,
main/pwrmgr.c, components/osd/osd.c, components/osd/osd.h,
components/osd/osd_default.c, components/osd/osd_default.h,
sdkconfig.defaults. README.md, CHANGELOG.md and .gitignore were also edited.
The full change list is the git history after commit 63ed3b6.

The changes add a Wi-Fi station, a BLE peripheral, and a short-text Grok
link (serial, BLE, and an HTTP proxy). They do not add Shiny Relay features.

Source for binaries
-------------------
